Z||000003||Bluemagic||05-11-2001||12:01 AM||||I just put a set in my 85 SE last weekend and it was not hard to do,what I did was to pot some white paint on the bottom of the aux pod to mark the position if you are using the plug in harness pull the plug out so you canalso mark the position.Take a dremel tool to cut the paint prints left by the guage pod just a shade bigger than the legs so theydrop through then cut a square hole to drop through the plug wiring.You have to remove the radio trim also the ac panel in order to route the wiredown and across to the instrument panel where the wire wil connect. have fun.||||reg||3
