Z||000006||Vlad||05-11-2001||07:47 PM||||Ok <P>Just checked it.<P>The piece that you have to cut is 8 3/4 inch on 3 1/2 inch.<P>It has to be cut exactly in the middle so take 1 inch from each side of the surround.<P>That's all.||||reg||1
